    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshuba mbona omumalaika ondijo omunyamani naruga omw'iguru, ayefubikire ekichwi, omuhangazima gumurabire aha mutwe, obusobwe nibushusha eizoba, kandi amaguru ga wenene nigashusha enyomyo z'omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba akwete akatabo kashurwire. Okugurukwe okwa bulyo akwemeleza aha nyanja, okwa bumosho akwemeleza aha rukaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okw'obon'entare nesinda, ayeta n'eiraka lihango. Kayayesire zisharuka enkuba mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkuba ezo mushanju kazabaire zasharukire, nkaba naija kuhandika, aho mpulira eiraka lyemire omw'iguru niligamba liti, “Eby'enkuba mushanju zagamba obikomese omuhuri otabihandika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumalaika owo naboine ayemeleire aha nyanja n'aha rukaru aimukya omukonogwe gwa bulyo agwolekeize omw'iguru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yarahira obuso bwa Ruhanga asingireho eirai lyona, ayatonzire eiguru n'ebikali omwo, ensi n'ebikali omwo, enyanja n'ebikali omwo, okwo hatabaho kukelererwa kushaagaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo omumalaika wa mushanju aratera enzamba, nirwo Ruhanga aragobesheleza ekyebishokye, nk'okwo yagambiire abairube abarangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho eiraka elyo nabaire mpuliire niligamba lyemire omw'iguru lishuba lingambira liti, “Ogende okwate ekitabo ekishurwire omu ngaro z'omumalaika ayemeleire aha nyanja n'aha rukaru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo ngenda ngoba omumalaika, mugambira kumpa akatabo ako. Omumalaika ogwo angambira ati, “Katware okalye, omu kanwa karakunulira nk'obwoki, kyonkai omu rubunda kakweme kubi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumalaika mwihya akatabo omu byara nkalya. Omu kanwa kanura bundi bwoki, kyonkai kanabaire nakaliire kanyema kubi omu rubunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ngambirwa kuranga ebiragwera amahanga gangi, abantu aba buli ngeli, n'abakagamba endimi ezitali zimoi n'abakama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
